#!/usr/local/bin/dyalogscript
⍝ APL Othello on the web: serves web/static and plays ui/App.apln with each browser that connects (web/Server.aplc).
⍝ Run from the project root: ./web/serve.apls [port]   (default 8080). Build web/static/client.* first: see README.
⎕IO←0
root←⊃1⎕NPARTS''
z←{2⎕FIX'file://',root,⍵}¨'src/Othello.apln' 'src/Games.apln' 'ui/App.apln' 'web/Remote.aplc' 'web/Server.aplc'
rl←0⎕FIX'file://',root,'vendor/raylibAPL/link/raylib.apln'      ⍝ for raylib's key and button codes; no native library is loaded
a←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
port←{0=≢⍵:8080 ⋄ ⊃⊃(//)⎕VFI⊃⌽⍵}a/⍨∧/¨a∊¨⊂⎕D
s←⎕NEW #.Server(port(root,'web/static/')#.App rl)
s.Start
⎕←'APL Othello: ',s.State,' on port ',⍕s.Port
:While s.State≡'running' ⋄ ⎕DL 1 ⋄ :EndWhile
⎕←'APL Othello: ',s.State,' ',s.Error
